<title>UK: Total sets 700 million French franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Total sets 700 million French franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Compagnie Parisienne de Reescompte.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOTAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    25.OCT.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  105.431   PAY DATE    12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.7 PCT   REOFFER    104.131   SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING ISSUE LAUNCHED JUNE 1996</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OCTOBER 2008 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS O.333 PCT ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
